cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "RAINS: Resilient & Affordable Implementation of Natural flood management using SHETRAN"
abstract: >-
  RAINS couples the SHETRAN hydrological model with the Non-dominated Sorting
  Genetic Algorithm II (NSGA-II) to optimise the location and combined size of
  Natural Flood Management (NFM) features: runoff attenuation features
  (storage), woodland and improved grassland/soil.
version: "0.1.0"
authors:
